'' A CALL CHECK SCORES AGAINST AN OVERLOAD SET AND CANNOT BIND IS NOT LOWERED AS THE FIRST
'' OVERLOAD. 'P4( s )': s converts only through 'operator cast( ) as string', which the scoring
'' does not model, so Check neither binds the call nor reports it -- fbc-modern 1.20 says 99
'' (measured 2026-11-23). Lowering used to run the name's binding, the first overload declared.
'' Check marks the call (SemanticInfo.unbound, overload.tiko ResolveCall_) and every
'' call-lowering path refuses a marked one, so the build stops at the call. TKO0994 is the stop,
'' not the goal: once such a cast is judged, this is TKO0632. (The tie this test first held is
'' TKO0660 now -- overload-udt-tie.)
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -c tests/diagnostics/src/overload-unbound-refused.bas -o tests/diagnostics/src/overload-unbound-refused.o
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 4
'' EXPECT-OUT: overload-unbound-refused.bas(23,1): error TKO0994
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 1
